 kit help - prints what kit is and its verbs by group, one verb's page, or one group's verbs

   <verb>   a verb's name, or the start of one: kit help re matches rebase and region
   <group>  a group's name, as kit help heads them: kit help plumbing lists the verbs that scripts,
            the hooks, and the TUI call, which kit help sums up in one line


 kit help
